primitive=('Delegated accessible UI primitive; no business success or persistence owned here','None; callbacks/props delegated to caller','Caller owns business permission checks','Native/Radix disabled, keyboard and focus semantics; no simulated API responses','Caller action tests and phase3.spec.ts mobile/keyboard; no dedicated test for every unused primitive')
lines=['# Phase 3 action audit matrix','',f"Inspected {len(data['controls'])} source controls across {len(set(r['file'] for r in data['controls']))} files. JSX loops are recorded once with their dynamic expression; every source handler and control location remains in `action-inventory.json`. Delegated primitive definitions are included; zero-handler submit buttons delegate to their enclosing forms, and anchors have real destinations.",'','This is a source-level inventory, not a claim that each unused design-system primitive has its own browser test. Tests named below cover action owners and shared invariants; external-provider responses in automated tests are offline fixtures. Live verification performs reads only.','', '| Owner | Expected state change | API / persistence | Required authority | Success/error, disabled and confirmation behavior | Verification |','|---|---|---|---|---|---|']
